  "question": {
    "text": "A glass prism of refractive index $1.5$ is immersed in water (refractive index $\\frac{4}{3}$ ) as shown in figure. A light beam incident normally on the face $A B$ is\n$$\n\\text { totally reflected to reach the face } B C \\text {, if }\n$$\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/Vws4CcrVmIRBwZZeH2zzpyPZu4eDUALuwZDP-yBlB1o.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "vnAnu",
      "text": "\n$\\sin \\theta>\\frac{5}{9}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b0PTV",
      "text": "\n$\\sin \\theta>\\frac{2}{3}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "lhWJ2",
      "text": "\n$\\sin \\theta>\\frac{8}{9}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "adIYP",
      "text": "\n$\\sin \\theta>\\frac{1}{3}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "For total internal reflection on face $A C$ $\\theta>$ critical angle $(C)$ and $\\sin \\theta \\geq \\sin C$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\sin \\theta \\geq \\frac{1}{w_{\\mu_g}} \\\\\n& \\sin \\theta \\geq \\frac{\\mu_w}{\\mu_g} \\Rightarrow \\sin \\theta \\geq \\frac{\\frac{4}{3}}{\\frac{3}{2}} \\\\\n& \\therefore \\quad \\sin \\theta \\geq \\frac{8}{9} .\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
